    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like \"symptoms\" to me. it feels like reality. i see the exhaustion in their eyes every single day. like, i’m just this constant problem they have to solve. if i wasn't here, there wouldn't be a problem to solve anymore. things would just... be easier for them. wouldn't they?",
