    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that. but i just mean... if someone loves you, wouldn't they want you to stop hurting them? i'm hurting them just by existing. if i could just step out of the way, they could finally breathe again. it almost feels like the most selfless thing i could do is just let them have their lives back.",
